  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Mappy the mouse had a son named Happy. Happy has grown up and now wants to settle down with a wife. However, the girl he wants to marry won't agree to marriage until Happy can prove that he can provide for a family. So now it's up to Happy to collect a small fortune so he can please his would be spouse. Of course, the boss cat Nyamco and his legion of mukies stand in the way of making this an easy endeavor.\n\nThe game is a basic sidescrolling platformer. Happy can defeat his enemies by kicking them. He can also perform a jump, and while he's up in the air, he can spin his tail so he can glide in the air for a short period of time, which is useful for clearing large chasms. Littered throughout the levels are treasure boxes and coins which earn money for Happy, which in turn can be spent on items for domestic living. On the other hand, every time Happy is hit by an enemy, he loses some money, though a money bag will appear allowing Happy to recollect some of the lost money.\n\nAfter each stage, Happy is presented with a slot machine ran by Nyamco. First, Happy spins the wheel to see a prize. Prizes range from extra lives to domestic items. Now, to actually win these  prizes, Happy must go up against one of the Mukies in a minigame. If he fails to win the minigame, he can be penalized by losing some money, domestic items, or even a life. Minigames include waving flags by following Nyamco's orders. There's also a  minigame where Happy stands back to back with a mukie and they try to push each other off a platform.  The other minigame involves trying to spot more differences in a picture than the opponent can.\n\nAfter the minigame is over, Happy goes to a shop, where he can purchase items for his house. Buying these items will prove to the bride to be that Happy is worth marrying.\n\nThe two player game has both players, (one playing as Happy, the other as his brother Rappy), competing against each other to collect the most assets to prove their worth as a suitable husband."
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Mappy Kids sur Nes est un jeu de plates-formes en 2D du type Mario dans lequel vous incarnez une petite souris qui peut frapper ses adversaires ou encore faire tourner sa queue à la manière d'un hélicoptère pour gérer sa chute."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Mappy Kids on Nes ist ein 2D-Plattformspiel im Mario-Stil, in dem Sie als kleine Maus spielen, die ihre Gegner treffen oder sogar ihren Schwanz wie einen Hubschrauber drehen kann, um ihren Sturz zu bewältigen."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "En Mappy, el ratón Happy, hijo de Mappy, busca demostrar que puede mantener una familia para casarse con su amada. Para ello, debe recolectar una fortuna mientras enfrenta al gato jefe Nyamco y sus mukies. Este juego de plataformas de desplazamiento lateral permite a Happy derrotar enemigos con patadas, saltar y usar su cola para planear en el aire, lo que le ayuda a cruzar grandes abismos.\r\n\r\nDurante los niveles, Happy recoge monedas y tesoros que puede usar para comprar artículos domésticos. Si un enemigo lo golpea, pierde dinero, pero puede recuperarlo al recoger las bolsas que aparecen tras el impacto. El objetivo es completar los niveles, recolectar suficiente dinero y preparar la vida que desea."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "Mappy il topo aveva un figlio di nome Happy. Happy è cresciuto e ora vuole vivere con una moglie. Tuttavia, la ragazza che vuole sposare non accetterà il matrimonio finché Happy non dimostrerà di poter mantenere una famiglia. Quindi ora tocca a Happy accumulare una piccola fortuna per compiacere la sua futura moglie. Ovviamente, il boss cat Nyamco e la sua legione di muki impediscono che ciò sia facile."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "O rato Mappy teve um filho chamado Happy. Happy cresceu e agora quer morar com uma esposa. No entanto, a garota com quem ele quer se casar não vai concordar com o casamento até que Happy prove que pode sustentar uma família. Portanto, agora cabe a Happy juntar uma pequena fortuna para agradar a sua futura esposa. Claro, o gato chefe Nyamco e sua legião de mukies impedem que isso seja fácil.\r\n"
    }
  ],
